      {
        "id": 129526,
        "name": "phantaskippy",
        "username": "phantaskippy",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantaskippy/{size}/1897_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-02-06T17:32:04.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>By rule Proletariat is one ally, any effect that designates Ally would have to effect every one of his targets or none of them.</p><p>That's the main reason I figured ally would mean target, but according to the rulings we have he is one Ally.</p>",
